{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scout ahead and make every shot count with the Green Recon Weapon Skin Set. This skin can be applied to six different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Green Recon Weapon Skin can be equipped in the Loadout menu for the Security faction for the following weapons:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rifleman, Demolitions: M4A1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Advisor: MK 18 CQBR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gunner: M250</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Breacher: MP 7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Marksman: MK 14 EBR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Secondary: L106A1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These items are unlocked in-game immediately upon purchase and can be combined with other cosmetic gear pieces. They can be equipped in-game in the Customization menu, which can be accessed from the main menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Green Recon Weapon Skin Set is included in the Overrun Set Bundle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2606130?t=1745337569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2606130?t=1745337569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606130/4d27aa519daf0cde8cd9a77e1f530f3800d0d944/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745337569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606130/4d27aa519daf0cde8cd9a77e1f530f3800d0d944/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745337569","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"